# ENTER release selects level; arrows move; ESC release returns to menu; S twice selects exit.
at 100 key ENTER down
at 101 key ENTER up
at 150 key RIGHT down
at 200 key RIGHT up
at 240 key DOWN down
at 260 key DOWN up
at 500 key ESC down
at 501 key ESC up
at 550 key S down
at 551 key S up
at 580 key S down
at 581 key S up
at 610 key ENTER down
at 611 key ENTER up
